  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **One in Seven** (1 review): Near the end of One in Seven there is a Teen Town jam [2]\n- **New Song** (1 review): The listed new song is identified as Tuesday Night Squad [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Nene**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Kalen**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **New Song**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2001-11-09.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 11 songs; 135 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Atticus from The Formula joined the band on congas [1]\n- The crowd was clearly into the show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2001-11-09.shnf**: taped by Eric Dahlgren; source: AKG 481 -> Sound Devices USBPre 1.5 -> Dell Inspiron (24 bit/48 kHz) [1]. Also: Mic was clamped to the balcony, dead front center, roughly 20 feet from the stage [1]",
